n the balcony with a cup of coffee and watching the neighborhood wake up.\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"The first few days were agonizing. My brain felt like a browser with fifty tabs open, all desperately trying to reload at once.\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:'But by the end of the second week, something shifted. The noise in my head began to settle. The frantic urge to \"do something\" was replaced by a strange sense of calm.'}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"I'm still learning how to be comfortable with stillness, but I'm realizing that it's in these quiet moments that we actually discover who we are when the rest of the world isn't watching.\"})]})}function d(n={}){let{wrapper:e}=n.components||{};return e?(0,t.jsx)(e,{...n,children:(0,t.jsx)(c,{...n})}):c(n)}return I(k);})();\n;return Component;"